# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# PLUVSTATS — environment overview (never commit real secrets)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# This file is documentation. The applications read their own files:
#
#   backend/.env.example   → copy to backend/.env
#   frontend/.env.example  → copy to frontend/.env
#
# Frontend values are public build-time values. Never put device keys or
# database credentials in a VITE_* variable: they are shipped to the browser.
#
# Backend defaults:
#   PLUVSTATS_ENV=demo                     demo mode unless explicitly changed
#   PLUVSTATS_DB_PATH=backend/data/pluvstats.db
#   PLUVSTATS_CORS_ORIGINS=http://127.0.0.1:5173
#   PLUVSTATS_HARDWARE_ENABLED=false       hardware ingestion disabled
#   PLUVSTATS_HARDWARE_KEY=                optional X-Device-Key value
#
# The demonstration seed is restored with POST /api/demo/reset.
# A reading older than `thresholds.staleReadingSeconds` (shared config) is not
# proof of hardware connectivity.
